Package: vicptpatronage
Title: Explore Victorian Public Transport Patronage Trends
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("pian0dan", , , "pian0dan@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a cleaned, tidy monthly time series of Victorian
    public transport patronage by mode (metropolitan train, tram and
    bus; V/Line train and coach; regional bus) from 2018 onwards,
    together with summary functions and a Shiny app that helps
    transport policy analysts and journalists explore how each mode's
    ridership has recovered since the COVID-19 pandemic and whether
    free-travel periods produced a lasting boost in patronage. Data
    sourced from the Victorian Department of Transport and Planning
    Open Data portal, published under a Creative Commons Attribution
    4.0 licence.
